### health
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### discovered services (= what facade reads from K8s endpoints)
GET http://localhost:8000/services

### same user three times (for conflict scenario / failover replay)
POST http://localhost:8000/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "u1",
  "amount": 10
}

###
POST http://localhost:8000/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "u1",
  "amount": 20
}


### get u1 (after the three POSTs above expect 60)
GET http://localhost:8000/user/u1

### get all balances
GET http://localhost:8000/accounts
